{{!
    @template local_embeddiscussion/preview

    An embedded discussion as the editor shows it: a header, over its skeleton's header and composer,
    without the skeleton's posts. Never live in the editor, for anyone - there is nothing to click
    inside it but the whole, which opens the discussion's settings for a teacher who may change them.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * anonymous (bool) Whether the discussion is anonymous.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "anonymous": true
    }
}}
<div class="embeddisc-preview">
  <div class="embeddisc-preview-header">
    {{! The editor button's own icon: only tiny_embeddiscussion shows a preview. }}
    <span class="embeddisc-preview-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{#pix}}icon, tiny_embeddiscussion{{/pix}}</span>
    <span class="embeddisc-preview-title">{{#str}}pluginname, local_embeddiscussion{{/str}}</span>
    {{#anonymous}}<span class="badge badge-secondary embeddisc-preview-badge">{{#str}}anonymous, local_embeddiscussion{{/str}}</span>{{/anonymous}}
  </div>
  {{< local_embeddiscussion/skeleton }}{{$posts}}{{/posts}}{{/ local_embeddiscussion/skeleton }}
</div>
